{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41978","headline":"登毘陵青山楼 · 李中","name":"登毘陵青山楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高楼闲上对晴空，豁目开襟半日中。\n千里吴山清不断，一边辽海浸无穷。\n人生歌笑开花雾，世界兴亡落叶风。\n吟罢倚栏何限意，回头城郭暮烟笼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}